  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Genuine and synthetic leather upper ages with time for vintage aesthetic\nLow-top, cushioned collar for premium comfort and style\nCrocodile-textured Swooshes and heel detail deliver distinctive style\nPerforated vamp and quarter enhance breathability\nFoam midsole delivers additional underfoot relief\nFull-length Air cushioning offers all-day comfort\nDurable rubber outsole with pivot circle provides reliable grip across surfaces\nClassic lace closure secures the fit\nThe Nike Air Force 1 '07 SE is imported.\nClassic charm and contemporary chic style join forces on these Women's Nike Air Force 1 '07 SE Casual Shoes. Crafted with a genuine and synthetic leather upper, this ever-relevant eighties-inspired silhouette features color-blocking with a crocodile-textured Swoosh and heel detail—a low-key pair with subtle luxe appeal.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Force 1 '07 SE Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Tattoo/Neutral Grey/White/Tattoo</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3289654</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<detai